 class="time-gap">T2 - T1</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="flex-1 oscilloscope-time"><table id="logic-analyzer-table" style="width:100%"><thead></thead><tbody><tr class="first-tr"></tr><tr class="second-tr"></tr><tr><td class="time-diff"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="oscilloscope-buttons"><div><button class="logicanalyzer-handle-image i18n" data-type="copy" i18n="Copy">Copy</button></div><div><button class="logicanalyzer-handle-image i18n" data-type="download" i18n="Download">Download</button></div><div><button id="logicanalyzer-reverse" class="i18n" i18n="Reverse">Reverse</button></div></div></div></div><div id="bugRecord" class="easyui-dialog" closed="true" title="Bug Record" style="padding:0;width:735px;height:515px"><div style="padding:10px"><textarea id="bugContent" style="width:100%;height:422px"></textarea></div></div><div id="dlgAddNewSupplier" class="easyui-dialog" closed="true" title="Add New Supplier" style="padding:0;width:300px;height:170px"><div style="padding:10px 20px 10px 20px"><table style="table-layout:fixed" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td class="i18n" height="30" i18n="Supplier:">Supplier:</td><td><input type="text" data-key="Supplier" size="16" maxlength="50" required="true"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div id="dlgModify" class="easyui-dialog" closed="true" title="Modify file info" style="padding:0;width:446px"><div style="padding:10px 20px 10px 20px"><table style="table-layout:fixed" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td class="i18n" i18n="Title:">Title:</td><td><input type="text" id="modify_title" maxlength="250" spellcheck="false" style="width:300px"></td></tr><tr><td class="i18n" i18n="Description:">Description:</td><td><textarea rows="3" id="modify_description" style="width:300px"></textarea></td></tr><tr><td class="i18n" i18n="Tags:">Tags:</td><td><input placeholder="Split by &#39;;&#39; for multi tags" data-i18n-attr="placeholder" type="text" id="modify_tags" class="easyui-combobox" maxlength="250" style="width:300px"><div class="easyui-combobox-select-droplist-button"><span class="m-btn-downarrow"></span></div><ul class="easyui-combobox-select-droplist" style="display: none;"><li data-value=""></li></ul></td></tr><tr id="pcb_lib_modifylink"><td class="i18n" i18n="Link:">Link:</td><td><input type="text" id="modify_link" maxlength="250" style="width:300px"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div id="dlgShowNewProjectNotice" class="easyui-dialog" closed="true" title="New project notice" style="padding:0;width:650px;height:500px"><div class="f14" style="padding:10px 20px 10px 20px"><div class="i18n" i18n="EasyEDA Pro has been released for several years and can completely replace the EasyEDA Std.">EasyEDA Pro has been released for several years and can completely replace the EasyEDA Std.</div><div><span class="i18n" i18n="1. The features are more comprehensive and powerful.">1. The features are more comprehensive and powerful.</span> <a class="i18n" href="https://prodocs.easyeda.com/en/introduction/std-vs-pro/" target="_blank" i18n="Features comparison">Features comparison</a></div><div class="i18n" i18n="2. Better performance and no pressure on large designs.">2. Better performance and no pressure on large designs.</div><div class="i18n" i18n="3. The feature is constantly updated, making drawing more efficient.">3. The feature is constantly updated, making drawing more efficient.</div><div><span class="i18n" i18n="4. Support the batch migration of EasyEDA Std libraries and projects.">4. Support the batch migration of EasyEDA Std libraries and projects.</span> <a class="i18n" href="https://prodocs.easyeda.com/en/import-export/import-easyeda/" target="_blank" i18n="Projects migration tutorials.">Projects migration tutorials.</a></div><div><span class="i18n" i18n="5. Support on premise hosting for enterprise.">5. Support on premise hosting for enterprise.</span> <a class="i18n" href="https://easyeda.com/on-premises-hosting" target="_blank" i18n="Apply trial for free">Apply trial for free</a></div><div><br></div><div class="i18n" i18n="It is recommended to gradually transfer to the EasyEDA Pro for project creation starting from now.">It is recommended to gradually transfer to the EasyEDA Pro for project creation starting from now.</div><div class="i18n" i18n="The EasyEDA Std will no longer add new features, and enter maintenance phase.">The EasyEDA Std will no longer add new features, and enter maintenance phase.</div><div style="position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:16px;max-width:300px"><input type="checkbox" id="notShowNewProjectNotice"><label for="notShowNewProjectNotice" class="i18n" i18n="Don&#39;t show this notice again today.">Don't show this notice again today.</label></div></div></div><div id="dlgSave" class="easyui-dialog" closed="true" title="Save as a schematic" style="padding:0;width:666px;height:440px"><div style="padding:5px 20px 5px 20px"><div class="savetype-radio" style="margin:10px 0"><label class="label"><input type="radio" value="new" name="savetype" checked="checked"><span class="i18n" i18n="Save as New Project">Save as New Project</span></label><label class="label" style="margin-left:20px"><input type="radio" value="exist" name="savetype"><span class="i18n" i18n="Save to Existing Project">Save to Existing Project</span></label></div><div class="choose"><div class="new"><table style="table-layout:fixed;width:100%" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0"><colgroup><col style="width:70px"><col></colgroup><tbody><tr class="tr-project-folder"><td class="i18n" i18n="Folder:">Folder:</td><td><div id="prj_folder" class="folder-input" tabindex="0"><span class="tree-collapsed"></span></div></td></tr><tr><td class="i18n" i18n="Title:">Title:</td><td><input type="text" id="new_title" maxlength="250" style="width:100%"></td></tr><tr class="tr-project-path" style="display:none"><td class="i18n" i18n="Path:">Path:</td><td><div id="path-pre"></div><input type="text" id="prj_path" maxlength="250" style=